# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: FORENX
## Cross-Platform Browser Artifact Forensics and Evidence Validation Workbench

Act as a senior digital forensics engineer, Python architect, application security engineer, UX/UI designer, and software testing engineer.

Build a complete, functional, well-tested, cross-platform digital forensics application named **ForenX**.

Do not merely generate a landing page, a dashboard mockup, static JSON, or demonstration-only controls. Build the real Python application, including browser artifact parsing, evidence integrity verification, case management, timeline analysis, validation, persistent storage, report generation, and automated tests.

Work incrementally. Inspect and test the existing project before modifying it. Create a clear implementation plan, implement each phase, run the available tests, fix failures, and document anything that cannot be completed or verified.

