## 5.6 Validation Lab

This is the principal academic research feature of ForenX.

Implement a validation framework that compares extracted records with known expected records from a controlled synthetic test dataset.

Support:
- Expected event manifests
- Actual extracted event records
- Matching rules
- Missing-record detection
- Unexpected-record detection
- Field mismatch detection
- Timestamp tolerance settings
